                            <p class="mt-5 text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-white/90 leading-snug">Every call is allowed. Nobody knows the total.</p>
                            <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[0.12em]">A gateway decides per call. A mandate needs memory.</p>
                            <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-white/55 leading-relaxed">
                                One assistant may release 800 euros of goodwill per case. So may another, in another team. What the two together may release in a month is a question nothing in the stack can answer, because there is nowhere for that number to live. KYDE holds the mandate at that boundary and stops the action when it is spent. <span class="text-white/35">Coming soon.</span>
